<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nextel raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nextel raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan upgraded Nextel Communications Inc to buy from market perform &quot;based on fundamental management and technology changes that we believe will pave the road for a successful new product launch of its PowerFone service.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/8 to 18-1/4.</p>
</text>
